UnitConcreteVotingRewardsManager::NotifyFeesAmount
├── when the fee accumulator was already updated in the current timestamp
│   └── it should skip the fee accumulator update
└── when the fee accumulator was not updated in the current timestamp
    ├── when the gauge has no pending fees
    │   ├── when the buffer is empty
    │   │   ├── it should set lastFeeUpdate to the current timestamp
    │   │   └── it should skip the fee accumulator update
    │   └── when the buffer is not empty
    │       ├── when the gauge is not active
    │       │   ├── it should set lastFeeUpdate to the current timestamp
    │       │   ├── it should preserve the buffered fees
    │       │   └── it should skip the fee accumulator update
    │       └── when the gauge is active
    │           ├── it should set lastFeeUpdate to the current timestamp
    │           ├── it should credit the buffered fees to the accumulator
    │           ├── it should buffer the rounding remainder
    │           └── it should emit the NotifyFeesAmount event for each qualifying token
    └── when the gauge has pending fees
        ├── when the gauge has no newly accrued fees
        │   ├── it should set lastFeeUpdate to the current timestamp
        │   └── it should skip the fee accumulator update
        └── when the gauge has newly accrued fees
            ├── when the total supply is zero
            │   ├── it should set lastFeeUpdate to the current timestamp
            │   ├── it should advance the last pending fees to the current pending amount
            │   ├── it should buffer the accrued fees
            │   └── it should skip the fee accumulator update
            └── when the total supply is greater than zero
                ├── when no token meets the credit threshold
                │   ├── it should set lastFeeUpdate to the current timestamp
                │   ├── it should advance the last pending fees to the current pending amount
                │   ├── it should buffer the accrued fees
                │   └── it should skip the fee accumulator update
                └── when at least one token meets the credit threshold
                    ├── when there are buffered fees
                    │   ├── it should set lastFeeUpdate to the current timestamp
                    │   ├── it should credit the accrued fees including the buffered residual
                    │   ├── it should buffer the rounding remainder
                    │   ├── it should advance the last pending fees to the current pending amount
                    │   └── it should emit the NotifyFeesAmount event for each qualifying token
                    └── when there are no buffered fees
                        ├── when the accrued fees leave no rounding remainder
                        │   ├── it should set lastFeeUpdate to the current timestamp
                        │   ├── it should credit the accrued fees to the accumulator
                        │   ├── it should leave no fees buffered
                        │   ├── it should advance the last pending fees to the current pending amount
                        │   └── it should emit the NotifyFeesAmount event for each qualifying token
                        └── when the accrued fees leave a rounding remainder
                            ├── it should set lastFeeUpdate to the current timestamp
                            ├── it should credit the rounded down accumulator increment
                            ├── it should buffer the rounding remainder
                            ├── it should advance the last pending fees to the current pending amount
                            └── it should emit the NotifyFeesAmount event for each qualifying token
